(text "VSYS from BQ24074 powers boost. The two independent 4-LED strings each receive 19.97 mA with 63.4k at ISET." (at 16 114.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 56e0ab39-553f-584d-a36b-5994b7c7ed88))
(text "EN follows filtered VIN. Native BL_PWM at 20 kHz sets brightness. Hold low through reset and panel initialization." (at 16 119.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid cfab6b07-bcf8-5cf5-b104-c284382aea74))
(text "L601 4.7 uH. D601 band/cathode goes to LEDA. C603 2.2 uF / 50 V. C604 330 nF." (at 16 124.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 5e2aa33a-10c4-5d66-8c2f-25a6718ce3b5))
(text "R602 10 ohms and C602 1 uF filter driver VIN. Keep the switching loop short and clear of microphone lines." (at 16 129.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid aaaafbab-02e7-5d68-b2ba-fe3f115d788d))
